  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Toast the bread slices until lightly browned",
    "In a pan, heat the olive oil over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened",
    "Add the madras paste and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the chopped bell pepper, zucchini, and tomato, and cook until the vegetables are tender",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste",
    "Assemble the toast by spreading the vegetable mixture on the toasted bread",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy"
